'''Pokémon Adventures: The Impassable Mr. Mime''' is the twelfth monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga created by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and [[Mato]]. It contains chapters twenty-seven, twenty-eight, and twenty-nine of the {{MangaArc|Red, Green & Blue}}. The chapters originally released in this book were later compiled into the final chapter of {{PAV|2}} and the first two chapters of {{PAV|3}}. As a bonus, it contained a sheet of Pokémon stickers which were not included with the collected volume release.

